#: crates/cineo-desktop/src/app/mod.rs:524
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"On Windows on ARM, the OpenGL that Cineo draws with comes from Microsoft's "
"OpenCL, OpenGL & Vulkan Compatibility Pack. Install or repair it from the "
"Microsoft Store, then open Cineo again.\n"
"\n"
"Details: {details}\n"
"\n"
"Open its Microsoft Store page?"
msgstr ""
"Unter Windows on ARM stammt das OpenGL, mit dem Cineo zeichnet, aus "
"Microsofts OpenCL, OpenGL & Vulkan Compatibility Pack. Installiere oder "
"repariere es über den Microsoft Store und öffne Cineo dann erneut.\n"
"\n"
"Details: {details}\n"
"\n"
"Seine Seite im Microsoft Store öffnen?"

#: crates/cineo-desktop/src/app/mod.rs:528
msgid ""
"Install your graphics card's driver, from its maker or from Windows Update, "
"then open Cineo again. Remote Desktop and virtual machines need 3D "
"acceleration turned on."
msgstr ""
"Installiere den Treiber deiner Grafikkarte, vom Hersteller oder über Windows "
"Update, und öffne Cineo dann erneut. Remotedesktop und virtuelle Maschinen "
"brauchen eingeschaltete 3D-Beschleunigung."

#: crates/cineo-desktop/src/app/mod.rs:532
msgid ""
"Install your graphics card's driver or Mesa, then open Cineo again. Remote "
"sessions and virtual machines need 3D acceleration turned on."
msgstr ""
"Installiere den Treiber deiner Grafikkarte oder Mesa und öffne Cineo dann "
"erneut. Remote-Sitzungen und virtuelle Maschinen brauchen eingeschaltete 3D-"
"Beschleunigung."

#: crates/cineo-desktop/src/app/mod.rs:535
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Cineo needs your graphics driver to draw its window (OpenGL 2 or later), and "
"this computer only has basic graphics.\n"
"\n"
"{remedy}\n"
"\n"
"Details: {details}"
msgstr ""
"Cineo braucht deinen Grafiktreiber, um sein Fenster zu zeichnen (OpenGL 2 "
"oder neuer), und dieser Computer hat nur Basisgrafik.\n"
"\n"
"{remedy}\n"
"\n"
"Details: {details}"

#: crates/cineo-desktop/src/app/mod.rs:538
msgid "Cineo cannot open its window"
msgstr "Cineo kann sein Fenster nicht öffnen"

